  "question": {
    "text": "An observer looks at a distant tree of height <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> with a telescope of magnifying power of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>. To the observer, the tree appears as",
    "image": null
